176
00:12:18,107 --> 00:12:22,834
At plus five, 61 percent contain love, versus 6 percent without steering.

177
00:12:23,932 --> 00:12:28,448
The price: negative log-likelihood, how surprised the unsteered model is

178
00:12:28,548 --> 00:12:32,423
