200
00:13:57,033 --> 00:14:01,763
The two lines again, and now every symbol has a meaning. The steering vector

201
00:14:01,863 --> 00:14:04,878
v sub ell is an element of R d. D is a finite set

202
00:14:04,978 --> 00:14:09,327
